# Code Owners

This file defines who owns and reviews different parts of the codebase.

## Default Owners

* @default-owner - Default owner for all code without specific owners

## Security-Sensitive Code

These files require security review before merging:

* lib/utils/encryption.dart     @security-reviewer
* lib/utils/rsa_helper.dart   @security-reviewer
* lib/services/auth_service.dart  @security-review
* lib/services/key_backup_service.dart @security-reviewer
* firestore.rules            @security-reviewer

## Infrastructure

* .github/workflows/ci.yml   @infra-owner
* pubspec.yaml               @infra-owner
* firebase.json             @infra-owner

## Screens (UI)

* lib/screens/chat_screen.dart   @ui-reviewer
* lib/screens/chat_list_screen.dart @ui-reviewer

## Services

* lib/services/chat_service.dart       @backend-reviewer
* lib/services/chat_list_service.dart  @backend-reviewer
* lib/services/game_service.dart       @backend-reviewer
* lib/services/session_manager.dart   @backend-reviewer

## Review Requirements

| Change Type | Required Reviewers |
|------------|-------------------|
| Security fixes | At least 1 security-reviewer |
| Encryption changes | All security-reviewers |
| Firebase rules | At least 1 security-reviewer |
| UI changes | At least 1 ui-reviewer |
| Infrastructure | At least 1 infra-owner |
| Bug fixes | 1 peer review |

## Escalation

If a PR is blocked without review for:
- 3 days: Ping @default-owner
- 7 days: Escalate to team lead